{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17609","headline":"郡中翫月寄江南李少尹虞部孟员外三首 三 · 羊士谔","name":"郡中翫月寄江南李少尹虞部孟员外三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圆景旷佳宾，徘徊夜漏频。\n金波徒泛酒，瑶瑟已生尘。\n露白移长簟，风清挂幅巾。\n西园旧才子，想见洛阳人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}